"""Validation of the project generated by the model, run before it is returned.

Four stages, in the order the LangGraph workflow (ai/graph.py) runs them:

    python      every .py file is valid Python (syntax, undefined names, no placeholders)
    terraform   every .tf file is valid HCL and consistent Terraform
    layout      files are where the project layout (from the RAG reference) says
    deployment  the project would work: terraform apply can package and wire every
                Lambda, and each Lambda can run (handler, imports, environment, IAM)

Each stage returns a list of Issue; errors make the workflow ask the model for a fix.
"""

